      <td align="center">
        <h1>Guild Charter</h1>
        <p align="center"><font size=4>W</font>e, the Ageless Wanderers, are a 
          family more than we are a guild.</p>
        <p align="center"><font size=4>W</font>e believe in truth, justice, and 
          helping others. We seek to advance as individuals and as a guild, but 
          never at the expense of others.</p>
        <p align="center"><font size=4>W</font>e are all equal in the guild, 
          regardless of race, gender, creed, class, or level. Our officers are 
          there to assist in the administration of the guild, to be our voice 
          when dealing with external groups, and to recruit like-minded individuals 
          of high morals into the guild.</p>
        <p align="center"><font size=4>B</font>lood is thicker than water -- and 
          nowhere is this maxim more evident than in the Ageless Wanderers. We 
          live and die beside each other and for each other.</p>
        <p align="center"><font size=4>O</font>ur word is our bond.
          Our honor is unquestioned.
          Our name is our pride.</p>
        <p align="center"><font size=4>W</font>e are the Ageless Wanderers.</p>
        <p align="center"><i>- Atharion Starblade</i></p>
      </td>
    </tr>
       
